flowchart TD
  REQ[Request handler<br/>creates event · id + key] --> K{Key already<br/>has spooled events?}
  K -- yes --> SP
  K -- no --> CB{Circuit breaker<br/>allows a call?}
  CB -- "no (OPEN)" --> SP[(Durable spool<br/>append-only log on a<br/>persistent volume)]
  CB -- yes --> SEND[Send to Kafka<br/>short max.block.ms,<br/>delivery timeout]
  SEND -- ack --> OK([Done: SENT])
  SEND -- error / timeout --> FAIL[Record failure<br/>in breaker] --> SP
  SP --> OK2([Done: SPOOLED<br/>request still succeeds])
  SP -.-> DR[Drainer · one thread<br/>token bucket, e.g. 200/s]
  DR -- "oldest first, when breaker allows" --> SEND2[Send to Kafka]
  SEND2 -- ack --> RM[Advance spool offset]
  SEND2 -- error --> STOP[Stop; breaker re-opens]
